// Dictate of Karametra — "Whenever a player taps a land for mana, that
// player adds one mana of any type that land produced." [CR#106.12,106.12a]
// — exercises `EventFilter::TapForMana` (new; `what` left `Any`, the event
// kind is already land-scoped) and `ManaSpec::ProducedByEvent` (new).
// Chosen over the ticket's suggested Vorinclex, Voice of Hunger: same
// TapForMana/ProducedByEvent shape, one clean ability instead of two
// (Vorinclex's second ability is an unrelated "doesn't untap" tax effect).
Normal(
    name: "Dictate of Karametra",
    mana_cost: [Generic(3), Green, Green],
    types: [Enchantment],
    abilities: [
        Keyword(Flash),
        Triggered(
            event: TapForMana(),
            effect: By(EventActor, AddMana(1, ProducedByEvent)),
        ),
    ],
)
